            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Launchpad 0.3.13</h2>
<ul>
  <li>The search field no longer takes keyboard focus when Launchpad opens or a folder closes.</li>
  <li>Arrow keys and keyboard paging work immediately; clicking the search field still focuses it normally.</li>
  <li>Clearing a query from the clear button keeps the existing, explicit refocus behavior.</li>
</ul>
